<title>VENEZUELA: Fabrica Nacional 9-mo net soars.</title>
<headline>Fabrica Nacional 9-mo net soars.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales 19.26 bln bolivars vs 10.46 bln</p>
<p>Cost of sales 9.90 bln bolivars vs 6.02 bln</p>
<p>Operational costs 2.84 bln bolivars vs 3.23 bln</p>
<p>Financing costs 794 million bolivars vs 214 million</p>
<p>Other revenues 367 million bolivars vs 610 million</p>
<p>Net profit 4.82 bln bolivars vs 1.21 bln</p>
<p>Notes: Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>All results are in constant September 30, 1996, bolivars</p>
<p>CA Fabrica Nacional de Cementos is a cement company</p>
<p>-- Caracas Newsroom 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
